commit 20bca5bead01c743255d5717923d8b7f1d3c728c
Author:     Eshan Iyer <79593316+eshankiyer@users.noreply.github.com>
AuthorDate: Sun Aug 30 03:10:35 2026 -0400
Commit:     Eshan Iyer <79593316+eshankiyer@users.noreply.github.com>
CommitDate: Sun Aug 30 03:10:35 2026 -0400

    feat(parity): decorated pot sherd drops, brewing stand remainders, trident and door AI checks
    
    DecoratedPotBlock.getDrops supplies the four stored decorations for the
    cracked-pot sherds dynamic drop (DecoratedPotBlock.java:181-188), read from the
    block entity rather than the block state.
    
    Brewing stand ingredient remainders are dropped when the stack survives and
    replace it when exhausted.
    
    RootPlacer.getPotentiallyWaterloggedState writes both waterlogged outcomes when
    the provider state exposes the property (RootPlacer.java:78-85).
    
    Also trident riptide gating, wooden-door detection for AI, skeleton horse swim
    volume, and loot pool functions applied to selected entries.

